Rule 14 (tensor should not be empty)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) − 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0

Rule 26 (tuple of ints used as kernel size must have length 2)
{v_1 : tuple(int)} |= v_1.len = 2 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, 1] : v_1[i] > 0

